hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1778","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne makhlooq ko paida kya. Phir jab us se faarigh hua to rishtedaari khadi hui aur us ne Rehman ki kamar pakad li. To us ne us se farmaya: Ruko! Us ne kaha: Ye uska thikaana hai jo tumhaari panaah mein aata hai qatataalluqi se. Us ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ho ke main us se milun jo tum se milay aur us se kaatun jo tum se kaatay? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, ae merey Rab! Us ne farmaya: To wo tera hai. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Padho agar chaaaho: (To kya tum qareeb ho ke agar tum wali bano to zameen mein fasaad karo aur apni rishtedaariyaan kaato). (Bukhari: 4830)"
"1779","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padho agar chaaaho: (To kya tum qareeb ho). (Bukhari: 4831). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur wo kehti hai: Kya aur zyada hai)."
